# Project rules → AGENTS.md

All project rules — core directives, developer profile, Android/Kotlin and spatial
constraints, token/cache discipline, git policy, and the **xTrack `#`-command
system** — now live in **`AGENTS.md`** at the repo root, the single canonical
source (the open AGENTS.md standard).

**Read and follow `./AGENTS.md`.** Do not add rules here — edit `AGENTS.md` instead.
This file is kept only so Cline (which loads `.clinerules`) still picks up the rules.
